  "disposition": {
    "district_positive": "bounded independent geocoder backend unavailable in traced fixed OH/provider and corresponding SIG implementation scope; propose conditional unsupported only for actual address-conversion positive, with new-image fresh-fix 801/permission/switch/invalid boundaries still mandatory and no pass claimed",
    "BLE_positive": "bounded fixed QEMU complete HCI/controller RF positive unavailable in current device_qemu/product and inspected relevant OH/SIG implementations; physical BCM/Unisoc implementations and full OHOS scanner exist. Propose only RF-driven scan/filter/A-B stop/pairing/data/controller positives conditionally unsupported, with new-image enable/rollback/permission/OFF scan/quiet/cleanup mandatory, not all APIs unsupported",
